    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2491990/extras/8328712fc42f51f17cce9f56fac8999f.poster.avif?t=1734807474\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2491990/extras/8328712fc42f51f17cce9f56fac8999f.webm?t=1734807474\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2491990/extras/8328712fc42f51f17cce9f56fac8999f.mp4?t=1734807474\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Setting</strong>: A sudden unknown computer virus &quot;X-mutation&quot; sweeps through the Iron planet, pushing the Iron to the edge of Armageddon. Most of them became violent mutants, known as mutators. In this desperate world, a small number of survivors are called &quot;awakeners&quot; who possess special abilities to resist the virus. And you, as one of them, must find hope to survive in this doomsday world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game introduction</strong>: The Tin can Warrior is a kind of meat pigeon mobile game, the player controls the tin can warrior free of different war zones, hunt the tin can mutant, get the bounty and kill number to upgrade the weapon to unlock different maps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features of the game</strong>:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf Challenge: Players need to hunt mutators in low-resource environments for bounty while avoiding their attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf Camp: Players can recruit other survivors in shelters to defend against foreign enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf Weapons: The game provides a wealth of weapons and equipment, which players can trade tokens to obtain, and upgrade them to fight more powerful enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Iron Warriors brings players to an apocalyptic world full of challenges and uncertainty. It's time to pick up your powerful weapons and clear the infected area.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2491990/extras/8328712fc42f51f17cce9f56fac8999f.poster.avif?t=1734807474\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2491990/extras/8328712fc42f51f17cce9f56fac8999f.webm?t=1734807474\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2491990/extras/8328712fc42f51f17cce9f56fac8999f.mp4?t=1734807474\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Setting</strong>: A sudden unknown computer virus &quot;X-mutation&quot; sweeps through the Iron planet, pushing the Iron to the edge of Armageddon. Most of them became violent mutants, known as mutators. In this desperate world, a small number of survivors are called &quot;awakeners&quot; who possess special abilities to resist the virus. And you, as one of them, must find hope to survive in this doomsday world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game introduction</strong>: The Tin can Warrior is a kind of meat pigeon mobile game, the player controls the tin can warrior free of different war zones, hunt the tin can mutant, get the bounty and kill number to upgrade the weapon to unlock different maps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features of the game</strong>:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf Challenge: Players need to hunt mutators in low-resource environments for bounty while avoiding their attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf Camp: Players can recruit other survivors in shelters to defend against foreign enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf Weapons: The game provides a wealth of weapons and equipment, which players can trade tokens to obtain, and upgrade them to fight more powerful enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Iron Warriors brings players to an apocalyptic world full of challenges and uncertainty. It's time to pick up your powerful weapons and clear the infected area.</p>",
